Package: ivpico
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: IvP helm as a Goby application
 IvPico runs the IvP helm and the maritime behaviors from MOOS-IvP as
 first-class applications in other middlewares, rather than through a
 bridge to MOOS.
 .
 This package provides goby_helm_ivp, the helm as a Goby3 application, the
 ivpico_helm and ivpico_interface libraries it uses, and a plugin for
 goby_moos_gateway.
